  <name>Glacier Ref</name>
  <summary>Collect and arrange visual references offline</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Glacier Ref is a minimal reference board for artists, 3D modelers, developers and designers.
      Drop in images, arrange, crop, flip and annotate them, and keep the board beside your creative tools.
      It works fully offline and saves portable board files.
    </p>
  </description>
